#
# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for the CI sanitizer job
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml, job 'sanitizer'), passed as
# UBSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>.
#
# Intentionally empty: every UBSan report fails CI (halt_on_error=1). Add an
# entry only for a diagnosed report, each with a comment naming the issue that
# tracks its removal. Syntax: <check>:<function, file or module glob>, e.g.
#   alignment:src/idlib/math/*.cpp
#   vptr:libstdc++*
#   null:idClass::Cast
# Check names: https://clang.llvm.org/docs/UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer.html
